the signs of rows 5..8\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.002147098489645*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[92]=",ExpressionUUID->"2eeeb73b-0c75-e645-8299-682faf507c96"],

